\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"CH Sound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"SH Sound\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ch</span>eap\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">sh</span>eep\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"lun<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ch</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"scrump<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ti</span>ous(ti sounds like sh)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ch</span>ip\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">sh</span>ip\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">ch</span>op\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">sh</span>op\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Lun<span class=\"strong\">ch</span> was scrump<span class=\"strong\">ti</span>ous! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It certainly wasn't <span class=\"strong\">ch</span>eap either. Don't be so <span class=\"strong\">sh</span>eepi<span class=\"strong\">sh</span>! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Oh my God this <span class=\"strong\">sh</span>ip is sinking! Gosh, you really have a <span class=\"strong\">ch</span>ip on your shoulder! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "It looks like someone <span class=\"strong\">ch</span>opped or sliced the pipe in half. We need to <span class=\"strong\">sh</span>op for a new one."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Intonation of Finished and Unfinished Ideas"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "If you raise intonation at the end of a sentence, it indicates that you have not completed your thoughts."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"underline\"> Unfinished Thought</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">The kitchen sink has a cracked pipe. It looks like ...</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "We also use rising intonation at the end of yes/no questions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Have you finished all your laundry yet? </span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Let me see ..."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The kitchen sink has a cracked pipe. It looks like ..."}, {"type": "example", "content": "And someone left the water running while we were out. If it had been turned off before we ..."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scrumptious"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "having a delicious taste"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Lunch was scrumptious!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob04aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about household problems."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sheepish"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "bashful; embarrassed"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Don't be so sheepish! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "astronomically"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "enormously; immensely"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It was astronomically expensive!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hose"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a flexible and hollow tube that carries fluids"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They said if new hoses need to be put in, they will do that."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hog"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to use something and to stop others from using or having it"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Vanessa was hogging it all morning!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "landlord"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who owns or rents apartments to people"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The landlord needs to be called. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pipe"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a hollow tube made of metal or another strong and rigid material "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: A new pipe needs to be put in."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob04aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a chip on one's shoulder"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to \u200bseem \u200bangry all the \u200btime because you \u200bthink you have been \u200btreated unfairly or \u200bfeel you are not as good as other \u200bpeople "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You really have a chip on your shoulder!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob04aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cracked"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "damaged and showing lines on the surface"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The kitchen sink has a cracked pipe."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob04aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Find a tongue twister with <span class=\"italic\">sh</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ch</span> sounds on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying it quickly five times in a row."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make you own tongue twister with <span class=\"italic\">ch</span> and <span class=\"italic\">sh</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying it."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Get a friend to try it."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I say the sounds <span class=\"italic\">sh</span> and <span class=\"italic\">ch</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice the sounds."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a tongue twister with <span class=\"italic\">ch</span> and <span class=\"italic\">sh</span> sounds."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice the tongue twister."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to a friend say the tongue twister."}]}]}